      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Kaalamegha Perumal\nThayaar: Mohanavalli Nachiyar\nVimanam: Ketaki Vimanam\nPushkarani: Ksheerabdhi Pushkarani\n\nTravel: This kshethram is located 10 km from Madurai.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nNam Azhwar: 11 Pasurams\nTiruumangai Azhwar: 1 pasuram\nTotal: 12 Pasurams",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
